===Etymology 1===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*h₃reǵ-}}
Borrowed from {{bor|en|frm|ressource}}, from {{der|en|fro|resourse}}, {{m|fro|resource||a source, spring}}, from {{m|fro|resourdre}}, from {{der|en|la|resurgō||to rise again, spring up anew}}. Equivalent to {{af|en|re-|source}}. See [[resourd]], [[resurgent]], [[source]].

